<div class="sec" id="al-problem"><div class="wrap">
<div class="head"><span class="eyebrow rv">The difference</span><h2 class="split">One afternoon on floor 4, two ways.</h2></div>
<div class="twoway rv">
<div class="tw bad"><span class="tw-h">Without Allocivo</span>
<ol><li><time>12:30</time>Early arrival for 512 spotted by the front desk</li><li><time>12:45</time>Six radio calls to find who's free</li><li><time>13:05</time>Daniel running late, nobody knows</li><li><time>13:40</time>Supervisor finds 418 not started</li><li class="end"><time>14:00</time>418 misses its target. Guest waits.</li></ol></div>
<div class="tw good"><span class="tw-h">With Allocivo agents</span>
<ol><li><time>12:30</time>Agent moves 512 to the top of the queue</li><li><time>12:31</time>Asha assigned to 512 automatically</li><li><time>13:05</time>Agent sees Daniel is late, moves 418 to Asha</li><li><time>13:20</time>Supervisor gets one notification, not six calls</li><li class="end"><time>13:52</time>418 ready, 8 minutes early</li></ol></div>
</div>
<p class="fine rv" style="margin-top:14px">Illustrative scenario with fictional data.</p>
</div></div>
